      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "For simulated objects: this sets PBD predicted position and not position before integrating movement.\n@param bMaintainVelocity - if true, simulated object will update previous position to maintain implicit velocity. Otherwise changing position will change velocity."
    },
    {
      "id": "get-particle-rotation",
      "name": "GetParticleRotation",
